{"id":"pendelook","name":{"en":"Pendelook","ja":"ペンデローク"},"desc":{"en":"A stone with powerful spiritual energy. Some say it is a crystallized soul of the dead. Ghost monsters drop it so it might not be so far-fetched.","ja":"強い霊力を秘めた石。一説によれば、死者の 魂が結晶化したものとも言われる。幽霊系の モンスターを倒すと落とすことが稀にあるの で、あながち間違いではないのかもしれない。"},"level":7,"locations":[{"id":"northern-ruins","name":{"en":"Northern Ruins","ja":"北方遺跡"}},{"id":"outer-islets","name":{"en":"Outer Islets","ja":"外海諸島群"}},{"id":"ancient-monastery","name":{"en":"Ancient Monastery","ja":"古の修道院"},"parent":"northern-ruins"}],"traits":{"id":"soul-steal","name":{"en":"Soul Steal","ja":"魂を吸い取る"}},"categories":[{"id":"jewel","name":{"en":"(Jewel)","ja":"（宝石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-jewel"},{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":68}